## Models

| Model | Type | Equipment slots | ip | mp | xp | cp | vpm |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
{%- for model in source.models %}
| [{{ model.name }}](#{{ model.anchor }}) | {{ model.types | join(', ') or '—' }} | {% for holder, capacity in model.equipment_limits %}{% if not loop.first %}, {% endif %}{{ holder }} {{ capacity }}{% else %}—{% endfor %} |{{ cost_cells(model.cost_columns) }}
{%- endfor %}
{% for model in source.models %}
<a id="{{ model.anchor }}"></a>

### {{ model.name }}
{% if model.cost %}
- Cost: {{ model.cost }} ({{ model.points }} points)
{%- endif %}
- Assault: strength {{ model.assault_strength | join('/') }} ({{ model.assault_strength_die }}), deflection {{ model.assault_deflection | join('/') }} ({{ model.assault_deflection_die }}), damage {{ model.assault_damage }}, AP {{ model.assault_ap }}
{%- if model.types %}
- Type: {{ model.types | join(', ') }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.fielded_in %}
- Fielded in: {{ links(model.fielded_in) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.replaces %}
- Upgrades from: [{{ model.replaces.name }}](#{{ model.replaces.anchor }})
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.replaced_by %}
- Upgraded by: {{ links(model.replaced_by) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.equipment %}
- May carry: {{ links(model.equipment) }}
{%- endif %}
{{- deltas("Grants its Unit", model.unit_modifiers) }}
{{- slot_specials("Grants its Unit", model.unit_specials) }}
{{- bullets(model.specials) }}
{{- slot_specials("In assault", model.assault_specials) }}
{%- if model.spawn_links %}
- Places: {{ links(model.spawn_links) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.assault_note %}
- **Note (assault)**: {{ model.assault_note | trim }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.note %}
- **Note**: {{ model.note | trim }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if model.equipment_limits %}

| Holder | Slots |
| --- | ---: |
{%- for holder, capacity in model.equipment_limits %}
| {{ holder }} | {{ capacity }} |
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
<a id="section-equipment"></a>

## Equipment

| Equipment | Profile | ip | mp | xp | cp | vpm |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
{%- for equip in source.equipment %}
| [{{ equip.name }}](#{{ equip.anchor }}) | {% if equip.range is not none %}range {{ equip.range }}, damage {{ equip.range_damage }}, AP {{ equip.range_ap }}{% elif equip.assault_modifiers %}{{ equip.assault_modifiers | join('; ') }}{% else %}—{% endif %} |{{ cost_cells(equip.cost_columns) }}
{%- endfor %}
{% for equip in source.equipment %}
<a id="{{ equip.anchor }}"></a>

### {{ equip.name }}
{% if equip.cost %}
- Cost: {{ equip.cost }}{% if equip.pricing %} — {{ equip.pricing }}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if equip.range is not none %}
- Range: {{ equip.range }}, angle {{ equip.range_angle | join('/') }}, damage {{ equip.range_damage }}, AP {{ equip.range_ap }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if equip.carried_by %}
- Carried by: {{ links(equip.carried_by) }}
{%- endif %}
{#- Every line has to hold: `requires` is a conjunction of disjunctions, so
    the choice lives inside a line and never between two of them. Joining
    these with an "or" would promise a build the Army tier rejects. -#}
{%- if equip.requires_all %}
- *Requires all of:*
{%- for requirement in equip.requires_all %}
    - {{ requirement }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{{- slot_specials("When shooting", equip.range_specials) }}
{%- if equip.range_note %}
- **Note (range)**: {{ equip.range_note | trim }}
{%- endif %}
{{- deltas("In assault", equip.assault_modifiers) }}
{{- slot_specials("In assault", equip.assault_specials) }}
{%- if equip.assault_note %}
- **Note (assault)**: {{ equip.assault_note | trim }}
{%- endif %}
{{- deltas("Grants its Unit", equip.unit_modifiers) }}
{{- slot_specials("Grants its Unit", equip.unit_specials) }}
{{- slot_specials("Grants its Model", equip.model_specials) }}
{%- if equip.spawn_links %}
- Places: {{ links(equip.spawn_links) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if equip.note %}
- **Note**: {{ equip.note | trim }}
{%- endif %}
{#- Orders an Equipment grants stay on the Equipment: `orders_gained` is
    additive (ADR 0007), and only a fielded Unit has the fixed loadout a
    merged table would describe. -#}
{%- if equip.orders_gained_movement_rows %}
{{- order_table("Movement orders granted", equip.orders_gained_movement_rows) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if equip.orders_gained_fire_rows %}
{{- order_table("Fire orders granted", equip.orders_gained_fire_rows) }}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
